# Cloudflare Pages redirects/rewrites
# Serve the shop catalog (shop.html) at the plain domain root, so visitors
# land straight in the product grid, but the address bar still shows just
# oraimoaccessories.co.ke (no "/shop.html" visible). Status 200 = rewrite,
# not a redirect, so the URL in the browser never changes.
/    /shop.html    200
